The files in this directory correspond to earlier version of
the Dyall double and triple-zeta basis sets. They are kept for
convenience, in case you have used them and want to rerun
calculations.

However, they are out of date (in particularly for the p-block
elements, for which Dyall has published updates) and SHOULD 
NOT be used anymore.  The proper Dyall basis set files reside 
in the basis/ directory. 

